ered Freya Sector (Aragoth System).', '19/05/2007\r\nI did some work here. --> Feniks\r\nBackground/Skybox ID = 1230\r\nA lot of stuff still missing\r\n----------------------------------\r\nredone all scales\r\nHexergirl', '14', '0', '0', null, '0', '0', '8', null), ('1755', 'Nifleheim Cloud', '-400000', '-250000', '-50000', '400000', '250000', '50000', '50000', '50000', '50000', '100000', '100000', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '1.22137', '1', '0', '9.33033', '9.33033', '1889', 'COMPUTER: We have entered Nifleheim Cloud (Aragoth System).', '01/06/2007\r\nDid some work here. -->Feniks\r\nBackground/Skybox ID = 1889 ---> Not 219\r\nNot sure with moon to use for Modi Eye and Blade.\r\nModi Planet Ring Scale = 3 \r\nModi Planet Scale = 3\r\nModi`s Fist Scale = 0.4\r\nModi`s Blade ID = ??? Scale = ???\r\nModi`s Eye ID = ??? Scale = ???\r\nAnd still missing stuff.\r\n-----------------------------------------\r\nmissing asset for Modi\'s Blade and Modi\'s Eye added, scales and\r\nsignatures redone\r\nHexergirl', '14', '0', '0', null, '0', '0', '8', null), ('1910', 'Kailaasa', '-188310', '-148160', '-50000', '529000', '490000', '50000', '50000', '50000', '50000', '100000', '100000', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '1.22137', '1', '0', '9.33033', '9.33033', '1237', 'COMPUTER: We have entered Kailaasa Sector (Capella System).', 'Background/Skybox ID = 1237, Planet Kailaasa ID = 465 Scale = 3, Moon Uma ID = 1432, not sure. Scale = 0, Moon Shakti ID = 297, not sure. Scale = 0.30', '1', '30', '40', null, '0', '0', '1', null), ('1915', 'Kitara\'s Veil', '-77110', '-74890', '-50000', '157000', '172000', '50000', '50000', '50000', '50000', '100000', '100000', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '1.22137', '1', '0', '9.33033', '9.33033', '219', 'COMPUTER: We have entered Kitara\'s Veil Sector (Capella System).', '', '1', '50', '0', null, '0', '0', '9', null), ('1920', 'Yokan', '-300400', '-226540', '-50000', '424000', '479000', '50000', '50000', '50000', '50000', '100000', '100000', '0', '